0,Kichwa language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kichwa_language,"Kichwa (Kichwa shimi, Runashimi, also Spanish Quichua) is a Quechuan language that includes all Quechua varieties of Ecuador and Colombia (Inga), as well as extensions into Peru. It has an estimated half million speakers.","Quichua, Tena Lowland",Quechuan
